  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oil for Development - Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports civil society organisations in their efforts to actively engage in and influence petroleum development in their countries. This initiative is about ensuring that natural environmental qualities and intact ecosystems are maintained, healthy, robust and productive, even in areas where petroleum resources are being developed, in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
